Stop right there!! Argh! I missed. Ah, it fled to the sea.
The strange presence has left the Shadow Road. How did we not notice? That creature used some spell to go unnoticed and summon Midranda's Specter.
We defeated Midranda's Specter, but it managed to send many monsters to the bottom of the sea.

We must report that many monsters were rescued by Midranda's Specter. I will prepare a full report.
I will need you to take the report to Pillai.

Please, come back in a while to pick up the report.

Receive 254,339,541,000 (Cronus: 12,028,782,960) experience points as a reward for your effort.
